## Line Item

The commerce cluster's priced line: description, quantity, unit price (base `AmountWithCurrency`). Line totals are computed, never stored.

```ts
import { LineItem } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/commerce/line-item';

@field lineItems = containsMany(LineItem);
```

Quote carries its priced lines as `containsMany(LineItem)`, and `line-item-totals` does the arithmetic over them; an invoice or order in this cluster carries the same field.

**Non-goals:** per-line tax and discounts; multi-currency within one document (first line's currency wins for totals).
